{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1327829-skill-specialties","id":1327829,"title":"Skill Specialties","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-07-27T19:11:40-07:00","id":1327829,"title":"Skill Specialties","content":"Some quick questions about Skill Specialties...<br /> <br /> I think I understand<br /> * They are gained during character creation for any skill at or above three dots, for free<br /> * They may be purchase later with XP when a skill rises to 3 dots.<br /> <br /> Questions<br /> * May you purchase more than one specialty when reaching three or more dots.<br /> * If not may you purchase another specialty when reaching 3, 4, and 5 dots.<br /> * Does a specialty grant a +1 enhancement on the skill it ties to (Athletics, Swimming +1)<br /> * Does it grant a +1 enchancement to other related skills (Athletics, Body Building, info gathering in a gym +1)<br /> * Does it grant both<br /> * Does it vary per system (Scion, Trinity, etc..)<br /> <br /> Thank you","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"> <hr /><b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Roleplaying</span> not <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Rollplaying</span> or <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Ruleplaying</span></span></b></div> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><u><b>Current</b> <b>Focus</b></u><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Storypath &amp; Storypath to Run CoD, VtR, WtF, MtA</span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Dungeons &amp; Dragons 5th Edition</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","name":"Graylion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25095_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"368"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-27T19:13:57-07:00","id":1327830,"title":"","content":"Additional question on Skill Tricks please.<br /> <br /> Can they be gained during character creation for free or only purchased afterwards.<br /> <br /> Thank you","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"> <hr /><b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Roleplaying</span> not <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Rollplaying</span> or <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Ruleplaying</span></span></b></div> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><u><b>Current</b> <b>Focus</b></u><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Storypath &amp; Storypath to Run CoD, VtR, WtF, MtA</span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Dungeons &amp; Dragons 5th Edition</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25095-graylion","name":"Graylion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25095_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"368"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-27T19:47:46-07:00","id":1327838,"title":"","content":"You get one for free at character creation if you have a skill at 3+ dots. If you have more than one skill at 3+ dots you still only get one skill trick. Afterwards, purchase through XP.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-27T19:55:29-07:00","id":1327839,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Graylion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1327829-skill-specialties#post1327829\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some quick questions about Skill Specialties...<br /> <br /> I think I understand<br /> * They are gained during character creation for any skill at or above three dots, for free<br /> * They may be purchase later with XP when a skill rises to 3 dots.<br /> <br /> Questions<br /> * May you purchase more than one specialty when reaching three or more dots.<br /> * If not may you purchase another specialty when reaching 3, 4, and 5 dots.<br /> * Does a specialty grant a +1 enhancement on the skill it ties to (Athletics, Swimming +1)<br /> * Does it grant a +1 enchancement to other related skills (Athletics, Body Building, info gathering in a gym +1)<br /> * Does it grant both<br /> * Does it vary per system (Scion, Trinity, etc..)<br /> <br /> Thank you</div> </div> </div> </div>On the questions:<br /> <br /> * You can purchase 1 Speciality at 3 dots, a second at 4 dots and a third at 5 dots, so you can have up to 3 Specialities at a single skill if have enough dots.<br /> * See above<br /> * No bonus on the skill itself<br /> * Just on related uses of other skills (good example)<br /> * No<br /> * Yes, actually my answers are all about TC.<br /> <br /> On Skill Tricks:<br /> You get 1 single skill trick in one single skill that is at rank 3 or more.<br /> You need to purchase any additional skill trick with XP.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-28T05:32:54-07:00","id":1327887,"title":"","content":"Just have to add that Specialties give access to some uses of skills that are not common. For example, to pilot some unusual vehicles, like the Space Shuttle, the character may need an speciality related to it, or to create some items the character need to have a specialty on a specific area of knowledge.<br /> <br /> It\u2019s not clear if this would allow the enhancements and the additional use, I would say yes.<br /> <br /> And it\u2019s not clear if the specialty must be on the specific skill in use to allow the use or a related skill can be enough, for example to pilot a Space Shuttle you need be specialist in space Shuttle (on Pilot skill) or if you can do it if you have specialty in space crafts (on science skill). My guess is you can use any related specialty for that.